# Timberline Haul (CIPlay vi_timberline_haul): quest "Down to the Mill" (13 steps)
# The log landing (0 -62, 2.5 m) and its notice at 3 -57; the logging camp (-30 10, 8 m), the cook's cabin x -24..-19.5
# z 4..7, the larder at -36 7, the bear round -42 18; the cut block (10 44, 10 m), the tally at 7.2 40.4, the fuel cache
# at 18 39; the mill yard (20 -22, 6 m), the loader engine at 24 -16, the mill locker at 26.5 -16, the crane lever at
# 26 -27. offset: set in phase 2.
island Timberline Haul
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Down to the Mill
wait 5
expect animals Bear 1
expect hidden milllocker
zone log_landing
expect step 1
read Haul boss's notice
expect step 2
zone logging_camp
expect step 3
read Camp cook's book
expect step 4
kill Bear
expect step 5
open Cook's larder
expect step 6
zone cut_block
expect step 7
read Feller's tally
expect step 8
use cranelever
expect message crane runs off the loader
use loaderengine
expect hidden milllocker
open Fuel cache in the cut
wait 3
expect story raft-Vasagatan_GasTank 1
expect step 9
use loaderengine
expect story loaderrun 1
expect shown milllocker
expect step 10
open Mill locker
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_MotorWheel 1
expect step 12
use cranelever
expect story lastlog 1
expect done
